        ],
        "text": "Grid Storage Review 2026\n\n1. Summary\n\nNorthwind Energy  added battery storage at three sites this year.\nThe Zürich site now holds  forty megawatt hours.\n\nThe sites are:\n\nZürich, with forty megawatt hours.\nLyon, with twelve megawatt hours.\nOslo, with eight megawatt hours.\n\n2. Operations\n\nEvery site reports its charge cycles each night. Faults are rare and are fixed within a day.\n\n2.1 Lyon\n\nThe Lyon site replaced two inverters in March. Its output rose by a tenth after the repair.\n\nFigures are rounded to the nearest megawatt hour.",
        "utf16": [
